    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Shadowkeepers",
    "summary": "Melee attacks whose Strength exceeds the target's Toughness get −1 to their **wound rolls** against an **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit of yours, other than a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE**, while it is in range of an **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)**.\n\n**Favoured Ka’tah: Kaptaris**: when you select Kaptaris from [Martial Ka'tah](vsdata:ability/adeptus-custodes.martial-katah) for a readied unit, you may also make an enemy unit **engaged** with it take a **battle-shock roll** at −1. Each enemy unit can be chosen for this only once per phase.",
